  "title": "Teriyaki Steak Tips",
  "description": "A teriyaki-based sauce does double duty in this recipe, first acting as a marinade and then cooking up into a finishing sauce for tender grilled steak tips.",
  "authors": [
    "vpecchia"
  ],
